# =============================================================================
# Bright OS — Lite Desktop Overlay (Phase 6.3)
#
# In Phase 6.3 the DEFAULT core is already lightweight (labwc + greetd).
# The Lite edition adds ONLY the following on top of the core:
#   - Small extra utilities for low-spec hardware
#   - Additional low-memory apps
# It still does NOT include Plasma/KWin/SDDM (those live in
# optional-recovery-kwin.list.chroot) and does NOT include Android/Bluetooth/
# Printing (those stay in their optional-* lists and are NOT installed by
# default for lite).
# =============================================================================

# --- Terminal is already alacritty in core; add qterminal as fallback ---
qterminal

# --- Archive manager for XFCE-style desktop expectations ---
xarchiver

# --- Resource monitor (Qt-based, lighter than htop with UI) ---
qps

# --- CLI torrent client already in core via transmission-cli; no need for GUI ---
